rooms_desc ({"You are in the Entrance hall of Pelgrim's cave house.The is not much to see here, it seems that Pelgrim lives like a cave-woman.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","A small cave leading towards some other, bigger onces.","A cave leading to some other rooms in the house.","The storage room in Prlgrim's house.This is where she leaves her stuff, when she isnt here.Don't even think of touching something !!A chest and a cupboard are standing along the wall.",0,0,0,})
